Z||000010||87ECO5||08-17-2001||07:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fieroburton:<BR><B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.motortrend.com/nov00/opel/opel.jpg">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Assuming Pontiac is going to bring it over here ...<P>If I knew it was going to look like that when Pontiac was done with it, I'd beg the wifey to let me spend our minivan money on it!  Heck, I'd promise everything from another diamond ring to a long vacation in Hawaii!<P>But, I don't have to worry about any of this.  Why?  Because I know Pontiac would (will?) ruin it with their ugly-a$$ tacked-on body cladding and ridiculous badging of everything from the engine size to the model level (SE, GT, etc.) and brake options (ABS)!!!<P>Get a grip, Pontiac!  Heed my warning:  if you build it - <B>AND KEEP IT CLEAN!</B> - they will come!!!!!||||reg||8
